    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32098772c14c750d5ce03c93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是与迄今为止的报告都不同的话语。\r\n“SEEY”和“ACVE”，都是指跟腱上的\r\n某个特定纤维。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c89900bd24a58cf3a6ff9449b197acd6ba0534570c93e462b7e6c270778ef60e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
