    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab30d460438614dbce72f09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许……我们已经捕捉到了那异样的感觉。\r\n不。现在高兴还太早了。\r\n总之，现在先……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be536c784a21bd5756ade3023c1d0e33ede3542fb90e7e70ea8b98dc8c907f6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
