      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——Negative。单靠冷却，\r\n无法恢复到“原型”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40becfc23f218e31c4a3a0fdc9563ec074d1d2f6fdf304ea6c6d41d129334f1",
