      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8822e7ddc497281a67bb53f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于——对时间的感知能力也完全消失。\r\n我们二人一起集中精力面对难关，\r\n丝毫不觉时间的飞逝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef78f7ac9becb3b29e9befa8999a8705fb47749c3634a79614f9bfb8d381d614",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d6d5e3cde761337e13a683",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每日。每夜。\r\n一天又一天。\r\n在这每天都与那悲剧宿命忘我搏斗的日子里——",
      "source_fingerprint": "48af45109c8fe916cefb408b4954af5a4e4da3e3ff14ec43870b3a56a9b612a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105117.json",
      "json_path": [
