      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d87e1472eeedc146a45fd5e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太阳仍停留在虚空的彼岸，不见踪影。\r\n而这恍如隔世的漫长旅程……\r\n似乎会没有尽头般地无限延伸下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a8b8750f6e7bcc33ad02d349b1c1541f679e804c0dc99670e8932d8325af77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
